   - New layout helpers: .ui-branding-color-field, .ui-branding-color-inputs,
     .ui-branding-hex, .ui-branding-preview-panel, .ui-branding-swatch-caption.
3. tests/units/front/test_ui_branding_settings_contract.py
   - Theme heading lookup tolerates the spacing class; new contracts: single
     card, admin scope stated once, colour help texts, hex accessible names,
     swatch captions, preview buttons not overridden.

